{"seq":3,"slug":"fragmentation","title":"碎片化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/memory-allocator-design/foundations/fragmentation","wordCount":1760,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"碎片化\">碎片化</h1><p>碎片化是分配器永远打不赢、只能管理的一场战争。它的诡异之处在于：程序明明只用了一半内存，却可能因为剩下那一半被切得七零八落，连一块稍大的连续空间都凑不出来，于是被迫向系统索取更多——逻辑上够用，物理上却「撑爆」。每一种分配算法的优劣，最终都要回到它如何在碎片这条战线上取舍。这里把碎片彻底拆开，给出量化的尺子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>碎片分两种，成因截然不同。内部碎片是分配器给出的块比请求大，多出来的那部分被白白占用——它来自对齐取整、大小类向上归整、以及每块附带的元数据头部。外部碎片则相反：空闲内存总量足够，但被已分配块割裂成许多互不相邻的小空洞，谁也装不下一个稍大的请求。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  R[请求 13 字节] --&gt; A{分配器如何满足}&#10;  A --&gt; B[向上取整到 16 字节大小类]&#10;  B --&gt; C[返回 16 字节块&lt;br/&gt;多出 3 字节 = 内部碎片]&#10;  D[多次分配释放后] --&gt; E[空闲块散落各处]&#10;  E --&gt; F[空闲总量 100KB&lt;br/&gt;但最大连续仅 8KB]&#10;  F --&gt; G[请求 16KB 失败 = 外部碎片]\">flowchart TD\n  R[请求 13 字节] --&gt; A{分配器如何满足}\n  A --&gt; B[向上取整到 16 字节大小类]\n  B --&gt; C[返回 16 字节块&lt;br/&gt;多出 3 字节 = 内部碎片]\n  D[多次分配释放后] --&gt; E[空闲块散落各处]\n  E --&gt; F[空闲总量 100KB&lt;br/&gt;但最大连续仅 8KB]\n  F --&gt; G[请求 16KB 失败 = 外部碎片]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>内部碎片</th>\n<th>外部碎片</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成因</td>\n<td>块大于请求（取整、对齐、头部）</td>\n<td>空闲空间被割裂成不连续小块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>度量</td>\n<td>已分配但未被请求使用的字节</td>\n<td>空闲总量与最大连续空闲块之差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型来源</td>\n<td>大小类、伙伴系统、对齐</td>\n<td>首次/最佳适配下的长期分配释放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓解手段</td>\n<td>更细的大小类、更紧的取整</td>\n<td>合并、压缩、Slab、Arena</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能否消除</td>\n<td>可压到很小但难为零</td>\n<td>通用分配下无法根除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"内部碎片的来源与度量\">内部碎片的来源与度量</h2><p>内部碎片是「为方便管理而付出的固定税」。它有三个稳定来源。其一是对齐：请求向上取整到对齐边界，<a href=\"heap-fundamentals\">堆与虚拟内存基础</a> 已说明返回指针必须满足平台对齐，于是 13 字节的请求在 16 字节对齐下要占 16 字节。其二是大小类：现代分配器不为每个精确大小开一类，而是预设几十个档位（如 8、16、32、48、64……），请求落到最近的上档，详见 <a href=\"../modern/size-classes-tcache\">大小类与线程缓存</a>。其三是头部：许多分配器在每块前面藏一个记录大小与状态的头部，这部分对用户不可见却实打实占空间。</p>\n<p>量化上，设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个分配的请求大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、实际占用为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则内部碎片率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>internal</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{\\text{internal}} = \\frac{\\sum_i (a_i - r_i)}{\\sum_i a_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">internal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4254em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>大小类设计本质上是在调这个比值与「大小类数量带来的复杂度」之间的平衡。一个常用经验是按几何级数布置大小类，使相邻档位之比恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1+\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>，从而把任意请求的内部碎片上界控制在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 以内——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 越小碎片越低、但档位越多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"外部碎片-长期运行的慢性病\">外部碎片：长期运行的慢性病</h2><p>外部碎片不在单次分配里现身，它是时间的产物。设想反复分配又释放不同大小的块，空闲空间会逐渐被存活的块「钉」成蜂窝状。某一刻你有 100KB 空闲，却分散在十几个小空洞里，最大的连续块只有 8KB——此时一个 16KB 的请求只能失败或迫使分配器向系统要新页。度量它常用：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>external</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mtext>最大连续空闲块</mtext><mtext>空闲总量</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{\\text{external}} = 1 - \\frac{\\text{最大连续空闲块}}{\\text{空闲总量}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">external</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">空闲总量</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最大连续空闲块</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个值越接近 1，碎片越严重。外部碎片是 <a href=\"../classic/free-lists\">空闲链表</a> 这类通用算法的核心难题，对抗它主要靠两招：合并（释放时把相邻空闲块拼回大块）和约束分配模式（让同类同生命周期的块聚在一起）。伙伴系统用强制的二的幂换来高效合并、几乎零外部碎片，代价是内部碎片，见 <a href=\"../classic/buddy-system\">伙伴系统</a>；Slab 与 Arena 则干脆从源头消除外部碎片，分别见 <a href=\"../classic/slab-allocation\">Slab 分配</a> 与 <a href=\"../modern/arena-allocators\">Arena 分配器</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两种碎片的此消彼长\">两种碎片的此消彼长</h2><p>碎片管理最深刻的一点是：内部与外部碎片往往互相牵制，按下一个就鼓起另一个。把所有块都按二的幂分配，外部碎片几乎消失（合并极快），但内部碎片飙升（最坏接近 50%）。反过来，精确按请求大小分配把内部碎片压到零，却让空闲空间被切成各种奇怪尺寸，外部碎片随之恶化。分配器设计就是在这条跷跷板上找一个对目标负载最优的支点。</p>\n<p>还有一个常被忽略的维度：碎片不仅浪费空间，还伤害局部性。被割裂的堆意味着逻辑相关的对象散落在物理上遥远的页里，遍历时缓存命中率下降、TLB 压力上升——这是 <a href=\"why-allocators\">为什么需要自定义分配器</a> 中「缓存与局部性」成本的根源之一。因此评估一个分配器，不能只看「能不能装下」，还要看「装下之后跑得快不快」。</p>\n<p>衡量真实碎片有一个工程上很实用的代理指标：分配器的内存放大率，即进程 RSS 与程序实际「活着」的字节数之比。这个比值长期偏高，要么是碎片，要么是 <a href=\"heap-fundamentals\">堆与虚拟内存基础</a> 提到的延迟归还，区分二者是诊断内存问题的关键一步，方法见 <a href=\"../practice/debugging-profiling\">调试与剖析</a>。</p>\n<p>把两种碎片的诊断信号并排放在一起，可以更快定位问题出在哪一侧：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>观测现象</th>\n<th>更可能是内部碎片</th>\n<th>更可能是外部碎片</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>小对象密集、尺寸杂乱</td>\n<td>是（大小类取整）</td>\n<td>次要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大量分配后释放不同大小</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（空闲被割裂）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单个大请求反复失败</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（无连续大块）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存放大率随负载上升</td>\n<td>缓慢上升</td>\n<td>持续恶化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓解手段</td>\n<td>更细大小类、少对齐</td>\n<td>合并、池/Slab、Arena</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li>这张表的关键用途是在动手之前先猜对战场：把外部碎片当内部碎片治（比如一味调细大小类）只会白费功夫，反之亦然。</li>\n<li>两种碎片经常同时存在，只是占比不同；诊断的价值在于判断哪一个才是当前放大率的主导项。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>碎片化是分配器只能管理、无法根除的战争；它会让「逻辑够用」的内存「物理撑爆」。</li>\n<li>内部碎片来自取整、大小类、头部，度量为多占字节占比；外部碎片来自空闲空间被割裂，度量为最大连续块与总量之差。</li>\n<li>几何级数大小类把内部碎片上界控制在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 以内，是空间与档位数量的权衡。</li>\n<li>内部与外部碎片此消彼长：伙伴系统牺牲内部换外部，精确分配反之；设计即找支点。</li>\n<li>碎片不仅费空间还伤局部性；用内存放大率（RSS/活字节）做代理指标诊断，注意与延迟归还区分。</li>\n<li>反模式：把内部碎片与外部碎片混为一谈，用同一种手段（比如只调大小类）去治两种成因完全不同的病。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"碎片化","id":"碎片化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"内部碎片的来源与度量","id":"内部碎片的来源与度量"},{"level":2,"text":"外部碎片：长期运行的慢性病","id":"外部碎片-长期运行的慢性病"},{"level":2,"text":"两种碎片的此消彼长","id":"两种碎片的此消彼长"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"堆与虚拟内存基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/memory-allocator-design/foundations/heap-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"空闲链表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/memory-allocator-design/classic/free-lists"}}